<title>SINGAPORE: Amcol 9-mth pre-extras loss S$93.74 mln.</title>
<headline>Amcol 9-mth pre-extras loss S$93.74 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				  93.74 vs  21.24 (profit)</p>
<p>    First final/dividend (percent)     nil  vs   5.00</p>
<p>    Turnover				 530.58 vs 981.27</p>
<p>    Losses from associates		13.95 vs   4.47 (profit)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss			    81.30 vs  35.73 (profit)</p>
<p>    Tax					 12.10 vs  17.02</p>
<p>    Minorities (loss)			0.34 vs   2.53 (gain)</p>
<p>    Extraordinary items (loss)	 246.09 vs   2.96 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - Amcol Holdings Ltd is under judicial management.</p>
<p>The extraordinary loss included various charges such as a write-down of assets, provisions and a reduction in the value of associates. -- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
